# Legacy multi-service overhead — unused by the single-service deploy
# (FastAPI serves the API + built frontend; no nginx/compose/k8s/Render).
# Kept in the repo for reference but excluded from the image to slim it.
# NOTE: do NOT ignore backend/ — src/main.py mounts backend/static at /static.
